  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Media Group&apos;s TV production for HIV/AIDS prevention in Tanzania is to be implemented during 2002-2004 through DSM Tele vision Channel Ten during prime air time. The program is named : &quot;Adolescent sexual and reproductive health education through media&quot;. The methods used include live shows,talk shows, interview and research and are of innovative character to reach the target groups.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
  </description>
